The Vauxhall Vivaro Sportive 2900 refers to the second generation (2014-2019) Vivaro van in the Sportive trim level with a 2.9-tonne Gross Vehicle Weight (GVW). This GVW was available with various 1.6L CDTi and 1.6L BiTurbo diesel engines. The Sportive trim added features over the base model, including body-coloured bumpers, air conditioning, cruise control, rear parking sensors, DAB radio, Bluetooth, and the FlexCargo load-through bulkhead.

